  "releaseNotes": "Fixed:\n- Transport-level failures when contacting Cloudflare (DNS errors, refused\n  connections, timeouts, or an outage) now resolve to a failed verification\n  instead of surfacing as an unhandled server error. Caller-initiated\n  cancellation still propagates.\n- The idempotency key is now derived deterministically from the verified token,\n  so resubmitting the same token is checked idempotently instead of being\n  rejected as already spent.\n- The MVC and Razor Pages validation filter no longer reuses a request-scoped\n  service across requests, so every request is verified with current options\n  and its own idempotency key.",
